/-!
# Orthogonal construction: template data

Generated by a program; do not edit.

A template (`ITmpl`) lists integer triples `(x, y₀, d)` over a common denominator `D`, standing
for the points `(ox + x/D, y₀/D − (d/D)·H)` (`ITmpl.inst`).

* `oSlotFloor k`: the floor features of a slot of kind `k` (origin `g_c`), left to right,
  including the floor cutters of its inputs;
* `oVarFloor`: the rectangle `W2` and the floor cutter of a variable (origin `a_k`);
* `oVarCeil`: the rectangle `W1` and the ceiling cutter of a variable, right to left;
* `oInputCeil pos`: the rectangle `W1` and the ceiling cutter of an input, right to left;
* `oBasin`: the basin of the helper `H_L` (origin `x_L`);
* `oTmplInputs k`: the input segments of a slot of kind `k`.
-/

namespace ArtGallery.Orthogonal.Hard

@[expose] public section

open ArtGallery.Stade ArtGallery.Stade.Chain

